      "latex": "a_v^{(k)} & = \\text{AGGREGATE}^{(k)} \\left( \\left\\lbrace h_u^{(k-1)}  : u \\in \\mathcal{N}(v) \\right\\rbrace \\right), \\quad  \n    \n    h_v^{(k)}   = \\text{COMBINE}^{(k)} \\left( h_v^{(k-1)}, a_v^{(k)} \\right),",
